"protiskluzovou podložkou a toaletou v 1. patře a menší koupelna se sprchovým "
"koutem a toaletou v přízemí."
msgstr ""
"All rooms have access to a large, spacious bathroom with a bathtub featuring "
"a non-slip mat and a toilet on the first floor, as well as a smaller "
"bathroom with a shower and a toilet on the ground floor."

