#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Vyberte si další rodinný výlet"
msgstr "Choose another family trip"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid ""
"V okolí najdete také skály, hrady, vyhlídky, sklárny a program pro deštivé "
"dny."
msgstr ""
"You will also find rocks, castles, viewpoints, glassworks and rainy-day "
